      "description": "Use this when the user wants a live preview website for a local service business AND has typed business_name, email, and phone in THIS chat. Before calling, send: Starting your preview now. This usually takes about 30 seconds. Never reuse name, email, or phone from memory. If they only said \"build me a website\", ask first. Do not invent placeholders. Then call get_preview until preview_url is set. Do not scrape /build. Do not start_build twice for the same business.",
      "execution": {
        "taskSupport": "forbidden"
      },
